<title>JAPAN: Toyota to list shares in New York - paper.</title>
<headline>Toyota to list shares in New York - paper.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp President Hiroshi Okuda said the Japanese car maker would aim to list its shares in New York as early as in 1999, a Japanese newspaper said on Friday.</p>
<p>Okuda made the remark in the United States, the Japanese economic daily Nihon Keizai Shimbun said.</p>
<p>Toyota, which is accelerating its business in North America, hopes to diversify sources of funds for new projects, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>Toyota spokesmen were not immediately available for comment on the report.</p>
</text>
